{
  "schema": "bruitfm-from-scratch-v1",
  "note": "Every setting reproduces a completed, reviewed run (see 'frozen_workflow'). Relative paths are below the source checkout; ~ is the user's home. Metadata come only from local saved copies; nothing is downloaded.",
